SKILL.md S3: Slack digest now emits structured cards with scope
(market|ce), ce_id, category (closed vocabulary of 9 types), author,
permalink, and timestamp. Cards injected into snapshot JSON at
market_review_context[].

Template: market-scoped cards render in §2 Market Review tab with
category chips and thread links. CE-scoped cards render in the CE
drawer under a "Slack context" section between resource blocks and
notes. Shared _ctxCard/_catChip helpers for consistent rendering.

build_snapshot.py: empty market_review_context[] placeholder in
snapshot schema — populated by the agent's S3 step.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
